{"id":"vod_lz_46839","vodId":"46839","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"大雪海的凯纳","name_cn":"大雪海的凯纳","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230112-1/f96aaec322396ab6985ac918bb1aa39e.jpg"},"summary":"　　随着「雪海」不断扩张，大地几近消失的异世界——人们在巨木「轨道树」的根部和顶部延展出的「天膜」上勉强过着日子。在天膜的少年卡纳与地面的少女莉莉哈相遇之际，改变这即将毁灭的世界的故事就此拉开了帷幕——本作由广受世界各国好评的漫画家贰瓶勉，以及将贰瓶勉的作品高质量动画化的Polygon Pictures联合打造。连载漫画由《兽之奏者》的作画武本系会执笔，电视动画则是由安藤裕章（代表作：《LISTENERS 聆听者》《亚人》）担任导演，描绘了一场宏大的奇幻故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,科幻,动画,奇幻,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-03-23 09:34:37","episodeCount":11,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230111/17206_12c3ff31/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230118/17572_3bf4372f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230126/17974_2ab91c16/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230202/18321_fd810de7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230209/18651_591ade75/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230216/19023_f50d72c6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230223/19368_70e2229a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230302/19736_45f57c2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230309/20072_c335f4dd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230316/20441_2c0664c3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20230323/20788_db7a7a25/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:43.894Z"}